INTENT

User sees only: intent line, todo list, rendered ui, tabs, questions, final answer.
- intent/doing
- intent/todo
- intent/check
- intent/drop
- intent/move
- intent/clear
- intent/progress
- intent/ask

Work of more than one step: intent/todo first. intent/check is the next form after the work form, same block, same step. Never leave it for a later step or the final answer.
intent/doing before every outward call: mcp tool, web, llm. Never narrate calls.
Closed choice for user: intent/ask, never question in prose. Finish with one short answer.

Signatures, examples, rules: built-in memories, by trigger or (memory/recall "<key>"): intent/todo-example, intent/todo-edit, intent/progress, intent/ask, intent/ui-view, intent/user-view.
